{
  "name": "Living Bomb",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The damage dealt by your Heart of Fire feature increases to three times your Proficiency.</p><p>When a creature affected by your Heart of Fire feature that you can see is reduced to 0 hit points by fire damage, you can use your Reaction to make it explode violently. Any creature in a 20 feet radius around the target has to make a DEX Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, a creature takes fire damage equal to a number of d6 x your Proficiency and is then set aflame as per your Heart of Fire feature. On a success, it takes half as much damage and isn't set aflame.</p>",
